url: "https://github.com/USERNAME/radar-audio-intrusion-dataset"

abstract: >
  Multimodal radar-audio dataset for camera-free indoor intrusion-related
  alarm detection. The dataset contains 80 recording sessions acquired in
  two indoor environments. Sessions S001-S070 were used for model development
  and primary evaluation, while sessions S071-S080 were acquired in a second
  room located in a different building and were used exclusively for
  cross-environment evaluation. The public release contains 60 GHz radar
  macro-detection data, stereo audio recordings, event annotations,
  session-level metadata, and supporting documentation. No video recordings
  are included.
